<title>USA: Citicorp Q1 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Citicorp Q1 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$2.01		    $1.75</p>
<p> Net			995,000		  914,000</p>
<p> Revs		   5,627,000		5,117,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted     476,000		  500,800</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1997 Q1 results were $2.09 before a previously disclosed incremental $60 million pretax charge for performance-based options.</p>
